{
  "Name": "Panda Security PSEvents Privilege Escalation",
  "Description": "PSEvents.exe within several Panda Security products runs hourly with SYSTEM privileges. When run, it checks a user writable folder for certain DLL files, and if any are found they are automatically run. Vulnerable Products: Panda Global Protection 2016 (<=16.1.2) Panda Antivirus Pro 2016 (<=16.1.2) Panda Small Business Protection (<=16.1.2) Panda Internet Security 2016 (<=16.1.2)",
